  "body": "MACLEANS COLLEGE | BUCKLANDS BEACH INTERMEDIATE | BUCKLANDS BEACH PRIMARY SCHOOL ZONES\r\n\r\nA brand-new home designed around simplicity and convenience.\r\n\r\nImagine spending less time on home maintenance and more time enjoying the things that matter to you.\r\n\r\n45C Hattaway Avenue offers the appeal of brand-new living in an established Bucklands Beach neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan kitchen, dining and living area provides a comfortable everyday setting, with access to a private, fenced outdoor space.\r\n\r\nUpstairs are three bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe, together with a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nFeatures to appreciate:\r\n• Title and CCC issued\r\n• Three bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms\r\n•  Open-plan kitchen, dining and living\r\n•  Master ensuite and walk-in wardrobe\r\n•  Internal-access single garage\r\n•  Private, fenced outdoor space\r\n•  Contemporary, low-maintenance design\r\n\r\nWhether you are entering the property market, seeking a more manageable home or simply ready for a change, 45C offers a fresh opportunity in Bucklands Beach.\r\n\r\nA simpler lifestyle starts with the right home.\r\n\r\nCome and see if 45C is the one for you.",
